  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.2.3:\n      - Adds an automated clean-install package verification script for supported target frameworks.\n      - Verifies core packages in netstandard2.0, net8.0, and net9.0 consumer projects.\n      - Verifies all packages, including AstraFlow.Mapper.EntityFrameworkCore, in a net10.0 consumer project.\n      - Wires package install verification into local packing, CI, and the publish workflow.\n      - See CHANGELOG.md for the full release history.",
